{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421130/extras/af1263addaf3155a7d193ed4e50dd441.poster.avif?t=1667831518\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421130/extras/af1263addaf3155a7d193ed4e50dd441.webm?t=1667831518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421130/extras/af1263addaf3155a7d193ed4e50dd441.mp4?t=1667831518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Gunjumping game for gunjumping people.<br><br>Evil Professor Y has kidnapped your father (yet again) and is forcing him to do evil things for Evil Things Co. It's up to you to rescue your lame dad. Preferably before dinner gets stale.<br><br>You play as Lily, badass teenager armed with massive revolver with insane knockback. Use the gun as your main movement tool and clear your way through challenging obstacle course with a clip size of six bullets. The controls are simple and intuitive. Aim and gunjump with either mouse or gamepad.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421130/extras/745ff408d5181e6f733f3fd5e1724c12.poster.avif?t=1667831518\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421130/extras/745ff408d5181e6f733f3fd5e1724c12.webm?t=1667831518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421130/extras/745ff408d5181e6f733f3fd5e1724c12.mp4?t=1667831518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tight and responsive controls<br></li><li>Countless ways to die<br></li><li>Quick respawn: you are immediately back at it<br></li><li>Total of 100+ levels in 4 unique zones<br></li><li>Zero water levels</li></ul><br>Gunjump Before Dinner focuses on two aspects that are in common among our favourite precision platformers: fun movement and solid level design.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1421130?t=1667831518","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1421130?t=1667831518","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421130/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1667831518","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421130/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1667831518","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421130/extras/af1263addaf3155a7d193ed4e50dd441.poster.avif?t=1667831518\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421130/extras/af1263addaf3155a7d193ed4e50dd441.webm?t=1667831518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1421130/extras/af1263addaf3155a7d193ed4e50dd441.mp4?t=1667831518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Gunjumping game for gunjumping people.<br><br>Evil Professor Y has kidnapped your father (yet again) and is forcing him to do evil things for Evil Things Co. It's up to you to rescue your lame dad. Preferably before dinner gets stale.<br><br>You play as Lily, badass teenager armed with massive revolver with insane knockback. Use the gun as your main movement tool and clear your way through challenging obstacle course with a clip size of six bullets. The controls are simple and intui